{"id":"fa999025216c4c01","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-analytical.md","title":"Analytic Set","display":"df-analytical — Analytic Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-analytical","aliases":["58-df-analytical","Analytic Set"],"display":"df-analytical — Analytic Set","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-analytical"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-analytical</span><span>Analytic Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-analytical — Analytic Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2:\\forall p\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R^2\\;(\\lVert q-p\\rVert_2&lt;\\varepsilon\\to q\\in U)\\}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2:\\forall p\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R^2\\;(\\lVert q-p\\rVert_2&lt;\\varepsilon\\to q\\in U)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Analytic}_S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Analytic}_S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytical} \\vdash A\\in\\mathrm{Analytic}_S\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\exists B\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})\\land A=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytical} \\vdash A\\in\\mathrm{Analytic}_S\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\exists B\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})\\land A=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Analytic sets are the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_1\">\\(\\Sigma^1_1\\)</span> subsets of a Polish space; the coanalytic sets form <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A set is Borel exactly when it is both analytic and coanalytic (the Suslin theorem).</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2:\\forall p\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R^2\\;(\\lVert q-p\\rVert_2<\\varepsilon\\to q\\in U)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Analytic}_S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytical} \\vdash A\\in\\mathrm{Analytic}_S\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\exists B\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})\\land A=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^1_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1","display":false}],"bytes":1152,"backlinks":[{"id":"cad15e7b31ad3190","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Analytic}_S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)$ (from [[../batch09/58-df-analytical.md]])."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-analytical.md|58-df-analytical]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["9375de7089953a2b"]}